  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"site-content\" id=\"content\">\n<div class=\"static-hero position-relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"padding: 190px 0 110px; min-height: 520px;\">\n<img alt=\"AJNETWORKS Strategic Technology Consulting\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/slider/slide1-home1.webp\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; z-index: 0;\" width=\"1600\"/>\n<div style=\"\n              position: absolute;\n              top: 0;\n              left: 0;\n              right: 0;\n              bottom: 0;\n              background: rgba(10, 18, 30, 0.68);\n              z-index: 1;\n            \"></div>\n<div class=\"container\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-10\">\n<div class=\"title\" style='\n                    color: #00a6ff;\n                    font-family: \"Nunito Sans\", sans-serif;\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                    letter-spacing: 2px;\n                    text-transform: uppercase;\n                    margin-bottom: 16px;\n                    font-weight: 700;\n                  '>\n                  // Strategic Technology Consulting &amp; Delivery\n                </div>\n<h1 style='\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    font-family: \"Montserrat\", sans-serif;\n                    font-size: 52px;\n                    font-weight: 900;\n                    line-height: 1.22;\n                    margin-bottom: 24px;\n                    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n                  '>Engineering technology<br/>that accelerates business growth</h1>\n<p style='\n                    color: #e2e8f0;\n                    font-family: \"Nunito Sans\", sans-serif;\n                    font-size: 18px;\n                    line-height: 1.8;\n                    margin-bottom: 36px;\n                    max-width: 620px;\n                  '>AJNETWORKS partners with organizations across Kenya and East Africa to modernize, secure, and scale operations through strategic technology advisory and custom software engineering.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-cta-group\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;\">\n<a class=\"octf-btn octf-btn-primary btn-slider btn-large\" href=\"/book-consultation\" style=\"\n                    padding: 15px 35px;\n                    border-radius: 4px;\n                    font-weight: 700;\n                    font-size: 16px;\n                  \">Book Advisory Session</a>\n<a class=\"octf-btn octf-btn-transparent\" href=\"/services\" style=\"\n                    padding: 14px 28px;\n                    border-radius: 4px;\n                    font-weight: 600;\n                    font-size: 15px;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n                  \">Explore Solutions</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"trust-strip\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"trust-strip-title\">Trusted by Leading Organizations &amp; Enterprise Partners</span>\n<div class=\"trust-logos\">\n<a aria-label=\"Rotaract Club of Nyali\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://rotaractnyali.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Rotaract Club of Nyali\" class=\"logo-wide\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/rotaract-nyali.webp\" width=\"160\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Bada Language Institute\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://www.badaglobal-bli.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Bada Language Institute\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/bli-global.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Siri Guru Singh Sabha Mombasa\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://www.sgssmombasa.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Siri Guru Singh Sabha Mombasa\" class=\"logo-tall\" height=\"48\" src=\"/images/client-logos/sgss-mombasa.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"SGSS Mombasa Medical Fund\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://medical.sgssmombasa.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"SGSS Mombasa Medical Fund\" class=\"logo-tall\" height=\"48\" src=\"/images/client-logos/sgss-medical-fund.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Visa Portal Solutions\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://visaportal.co.ke\">\n<img alt=\"Visa Portal Solutions\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/visa-portal-solutions.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"over-hidden\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-12 align-self-center\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// about company</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">\n                    Your Technology <br/>Consulting Partner\n                  </h2>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mb-15\">\n                  AJNETWORKS partners with organizations to analyze complex business challenges, design resilient technical architectures, and engineer secure, high-performance systems. We lead with strategic advisory to ensure technology decisions move business outcomes forward.\n                </p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-s1\">\n<div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-medal\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>Proven Delivery</h5>\n<div class=\"line-box\"></div>\n<p>Advising and executing on mission-critical software and systems.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-s1\">\n<div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-gear\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>Expert Stewardship</h5>\n<div class=\"line-box\"></div>\n<p>\n                        Providing end-to-end guidance from initial roadmap to long-term operations support.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-15\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"offset-lg-1 col-lg-6 col-md-12 align-self-center\">\n<div class=\"about-right\">\n<div class=\"img-small\">\n<img alt=\"Consultants designing software architecture diagram\" class=\"img-small-1\" height=\"370\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/home-about-small-1.webp\" width=\"270\"/>\n<img alt=\"Developer writing secure clean code\" class=\"img-small-2\" height=\"370\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/home-about-small-2.webp\" width=\"270\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"home-about-btn\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n<div class=\"ot-button\">\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/company/about-us\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE ABOUT US</a>\n<div class=\"space-15\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section-padd bg-dark-primary\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row text-center mb-5\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span style=\"color: #43D9AD;\">// Our Engagement Model</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading text-white\">How We Deliver Value</h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"color: #E0E0E0; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">We follow a rigorous, consulting-led engineering process to ensure technology decisions directly map to business outcomes.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<!-- Step 1 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">01</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-search\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Discover</h5>\n<div>Analyze business goals and technical gaps.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 2 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">02</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-settings\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Architect</h5>\n<div>Design secure, scalable systems.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 3 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">03</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-code\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Build</h5>\n<div>Execute with engineering excellence.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 4 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">04</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-shield\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Secure</h5>\n<div>Implement security by design.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 5 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">05</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-startup\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Deploy</h5>\n<div>Launch with zero downtime strategies.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 6 -->\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">06</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-support\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Support</h5>\n<div>Monitor, optimize, and scale continuously.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bg-dark-primary\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 text-center\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span class=\"text-primary-light\">// core capabilities</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading text-white\">\n                    Integrated Capabilities <br/>\n                    Under One Roof\n                  </h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-20\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">01</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-tablet\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Technology &amp; Digital Strategy</h5>\n<div>\n                      Advisory, audits, and roadmaps to align technology with\n                      business objectives.\n                    </div>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/technology-strategy\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">02</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-ui\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Software Engineering</h5>\n<div>\n                      Web, mobile, and custom systems built with security and\n                      scalability in mind.\n                    </div>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">03</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-report\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Cybersecurity &amp; Assurance</h5>\n<div>\n                      Secure design, application and network security embedded\n                      in every solution.\n                    </div>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"serv-box-2 s2\">\n<span class=\"big-number\">04</span>\n<div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-shield\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<h5>Networking &amp; Infrastructure</h5>\n<div>\n                      Reliable, secure, and scalable connectivity across\n                      on-premise and cloud.\n                    </div>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/networking\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pt-0 pb-290\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row mt--130\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4 mb-md-0\">\n<div class=\"misc-box text-white misc-box-bg1\">\n<div class=\"ot-counter\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"num\" data-time=\"2000\" data-to=\"20\">0</span>\n<span>+</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5>Systems Delivered</h5>\n<p>\n                    Deploying production-ready, secure software platforms and network architectures that support core business workflows.\n                  </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"misc-box misc-box-bg2\">\n<div class=\"ot-counter\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"num\" data-time=\"2000\" data-to=\"100\">0</span>\n<span>%</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5>Delivery Track Record</h5>\n<p>\n                    Engineering solutions on-time and with rigorous technical audits, ensuring smooth handover and system continuity.\n                  </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-120\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bg-light-1 no-padding\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 mt--170\">\n<div class=\"cta\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-9 text-md-left text-center mb-4 mb-md-0\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// outcome-driven engagements</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">Ready to align technology with your business goals?</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-3 text-md-right text-center align-self-end\">\n<a class=\"octf-btn btn-border\" href=\"/book-consultation\" role=\"button\">Book Advisory Call</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-100\"></div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-5\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// latest case studies</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">Featured Engagements</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-7\">\n<p class=\"mb-0\">\n                  Every engagement is designed to solve a specific business problem and deliver a measurable impact. We partner closely with our clients to engineer robust, maintainable systems built on trust.\n                </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-40\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"no-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"owl-carousel owl-theme project-slider\">\n<div class=\"project-item projects-style-2\">\n<div class=\"projects-box\">\n<div class=\"projects-thumbnail\">\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-bada\">\n<img alt=\"Bada Language Institute Platform\" height=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/projects/project7-720x520.webp\" width=\"720\"/>\n<span class=\"overlay\"></span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portfolio-info\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-info-inner\">\n<a class=\"btn-link\" href=\"/portfolio/case-study-bada\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i></a>\n<h5>\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-bada\">Bada Language Institute</a>\n</h5>\n<p class=\"portfolio-cates\">\n<a href=\"/services/software-engineering\">Software Engineering</a><span>/</span>\n<a href=\"/services/technology-strategy\">LMS</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-item projects-style-2\">\n<div class=\"projects-box\">\n<div class=\"projects-thumbnail\">\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-racnyali\">\n<img alt=\"Rotaract Club of Nyali Portal\" height=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/projects/project-720x520.webp\" width=\"720\"/>\n<span class=\"overlay\"></span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portfolio-info\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-info-inner\">\n<a class=\"btn-link\" href=\"/portfolio/case-study-racnyali\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i></a>\n<h5>\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-racnyali\">Rotaract Club Nyali Portal</a>\n</h5>\n<p class=\"portfolio-cates\">\n<a href=\"/services/software-engineering\">Software Engineering</a><span>/</span>\n<a href=\"/services/technology-strategy\">NGO System</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-item projects-style-2\">\n<div class=\"projects-box\">\n<div class=\"projects-thumbnail\">\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-sgss\">\n<img alt=\"SGSS Mombasa Medical Fund Portal\" height=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/projects/project3-720x520.webp\" width=\"720\"/>\n<span class=\"overlay\"></span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portfolio-info\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-info-inner\">\n<a class=\"btn-link\" href=\"/portfolio/case-study-sgss\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i></a>\n<h5>\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-sgss\">SGSS Mombasa Medical Fund</a>\n</h5>\n<p class=\"portfolio-cates\">\n<a href=\"/services/software-engineering\">Software Engineering</a><span>/</span>\n<a href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-item projects-style-2\">\n<div class=\"projects-box\">\n<div class=\"projects-thumbnail\">\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-transitflow\">\n<img alt=\"Transit Flow Logistics System\" height=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/projects/project4-720x520.webp\" width=\"720\"/>\n<span class=\"overlay\"></span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portfolio-info\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-info-inner\">\n<a class=\"btn-link\" href=\"/portfolio/case-study-transitflow\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i></a>\n<h5>\n<a href=\"/portfolio/case-study-transitflow\">Transit Flow Logistics</a>\n</h5>\n<p class=\"portfolio-cates\">\n<a href=\"/services/software-engineering\">Software Engineering</a><span>/</span>\n<a href=\"/services/technology-strategy\">Logistics</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"technology-v1\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading text-center text-white\">\n<span>// TECHNOLOGY INDEX</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">\n                    Technical Ecosystems We Engineer\n                  </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-15\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Code 1\"><div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-code-1\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>WEB</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" title=\"Android\"><div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-android\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>Android</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" title=\"Apple\"><div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-apple\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>IOS</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" title=\"Iot\"><div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-iot\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>IOT</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" title=\"Time And Date\"><div class=\"icon-main\">\n<span class=\"flaticon-time-and-date\"></span>\n</div>\n<h5>Wearalables</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-12\">\n<a class=\"tech-box text-center\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\" title=\"Tv\"><div class=\"icon-main\"><span class=\"flaticon-tv\"></span></div>\n<h5>TV</h5>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bg-map-dots\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading text-center\">\n<span>// our clients</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-headi